        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s146__2" value="Block Functions &amp;amp; Interfaces (notes outside the block diagram)&lt;br&gt;Parent contexts: i_can_registers distributes host writes and reads register values; i_can_bsp consumes helper outputs. The timing module has no child instances.&lt;br&gt;MODE_REG0 and COMMAND_REG0/1/4, COMMAND_REG: can_register_asyn_syn; asynchronous reset plus synchronous command/forced-mode reset. MODE_REG_BASIC/EXT,&lt;br&gt;ERROR_WARNING_REG, CLOCK_DIVIDER_REG_7/3/LOW: can_register_asyn; resettable configuration.&lt;br&gt;IRQ_EN_REG, BUS_TIMING_0/1_REG, ACCEPTANCE_CODE_REG0..3, ACCEPTANCE_MASK_REG0..3, TX_DATA_REG0..12: can_register; write-enabled storage without reset. Source:&lt;br&gt;can_registers.v:511-1076.&lt;br&gt;i_can_crc_rx: CRC-15 accumulator (0x4599), sampled_bit input, qualified enable, explicit initialization. i_can_acf: identifier/data masking and id_ok output. i_can_fifo: 64-byte RX buffer,&lt;br&gt;message-length/overrun metadata, release_buffer and status outputs. Source: can_bsp.v:1260-1424.&lt;br&gt;i_ibo_tx_data_0..12: combinational 8-bit reversal from tx_data_0..12 to r_tx_data_0..12. i_calculated_crc0/1: reversal of packed CRC slices into r_calculated_crc. Source:&lt;br&gt;can_bsp.v:1674-1690; can_ibo.v:66-82.&lt;br&gt;Behavioral FIFO arrays are internal storage, not module instances. Vendor RAM and BIST alternatives are disabled in this configuration; can_register_syn is defined but uninstantiated." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=18;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1" vlsit_library_sha256="D1631ACF98A920526B235E8970FEDDC9305EA2F0D6A35C6529CD220D62AFABB6" vlsit_library_entry="32" vlsit_library_cell="2" vlsit_library_instance="s146">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="2160" width="1560" height="307" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
